# Copy to .env.local. Everything here is optional.

# Space-Track.org account (free). With it, the default catalog is the full GP
# catalog including debris; without it, CelesTrak's "active" group is used.
SPACETRACK_USER=
SPACETRACK_PASS=

# Only needed if you add Cesium ion assets; the default map needs no token.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CESIUM_ION_TOKEN=
